[00:00.000]...
[00:14.220]Day by day
{"日复一日"}
[00:16.100]We have lost our edge
{"我们已失去锋芒"}
[00:18.460]Don't you know?
{"你难道不明白吗？"}
[00:19.810]Forgotten is the life we led
{"遗忘的是我们曾过的生活"}
[00:22.170]Now it seems
{"如今看来"}
[00:23.610]You don't care what the risk is
{"你不在乎风险有多大"}
[00:26.360]The peaceful times have made us blind
{"和平岁月蒙蔽了我们的双眼"}
[00:29.980]Can't look back
{"无法回头"}
[00:31.290]They will not come back
{"它们不会重来"}
[00:33.380]Can't be afraid
{"不能畏惧"}
[00:35.000]It's time after time
{"一次又一次"}
[00:37.240]So once again
{"于是再一次"}
[00:38.410]I'm hiding in my room
{"我躲在自己的房间"}
[00:41.310]The peaceful times have made us blind
{"和平岁月蒙蔽了我们的双眼"}
[00:45.280]So you can't fly if you never try
{"若从不尝试 你永远无法飞翔"}
[00:49.000]You told me, oh, long ago
{"你曾告诉我 哦 在很久以前"}
[00:52.650]But you left the wall
{"但你筑起了高墙"}
[00:54.750]Outside the gate
{"在城门之外"}
[00:56.650]So more than ever, it's real
{"所以比以往更真实"}
[00:59.550]It was like a nightmare
{"那就像一场噩梦"}
[01:02.180]It's painful for me
{"对我而言痛苦万分"}
[01:03.820]Because nobody wants to die too fast
{"因为没人想太快死去"}
[01:07.520]Remember the day of grief
{"记住悲伤的那天"}
[01:09.530]Now it's strange for me
{"如今对我而言如此陌生"}
[01:11.580]I could see your face
{"我仍能看见你的脸"}
[01:13.330]I could hear your voice
{"我能听见你的声音"}
[01:15.310]Remember the day we met
{"记得我们相遇的那天"}
[01:16.830]Now it's painful for me
{"如今这让我痛苦不堪"}
[01:18.830]Because nobody wants to die too fast
{"因为没人愿意过早逝去"}
[01:22.880]Remember a day we dreamt
{"记得我们梦想的那天"}
[01:24.970]Now it's painful for me
{"如今这让我痛苦不堪"}
[01:26.650]I could see your face
{"我能看见你的脸庞"}
[01:28.590]I could hear your voice
{"我能听见你的声音"}
